des at position 34 of the tRNA anticodon loop of substrate tRNAs (PubMed:32558197, PubMed:33771871). Required for the correct positioning of the substrate tRNA for methylation (PubMed:32558197). Required to suppress amino acid starvation-induced autophagy (PubMed:22354037). Enhances the STK11/LKB1-induced cell growth suppression activity (PubMed:17216128)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}